Thank you for sending the sample through — we've had a chance to review it.

Overall, we'd describe it as ${overall}. The specific points we'd like addressed are as follows:

${changes}

To confirm next steps: ${nextstep}.

Please let us know if anything above needs clarification, or if it would help to discuss any of these points by call. We appreciate the work that's gone into this so far and look forward to moving this forward together.

${signoff(tone, name, brand)}`;
      return { subject, body };
    }

    const body = `${greeting(tone)}

Thanks so much for getting the sample over to us — really appreciate the quick turnaround!

We've gone through it, and overall it's ${overall}. Here's what we'd love to see adjusted:

${changes}

In terms of next steps: ${nextstep}.

Let us know if any of this needs more detail from our side, or if a quick call would help talk it through. Really excited to get this dialled in!

${signoff(tone, name, brand)}`;
    return { subject, body };
